      SYSTEM   : Diamond_8k

      System Properties:
      NGVEC    : 1644           #### from compress_H2.py output (threshold 1e-3)
      NEUP     : 4
      EBANDS   : 0
      NEDOWN   : 4
      NORB     : 8
      EHZB     : 0
      ECONST   : 0
      SPIN     : 0
      FSG      : 0.701728       #### intra-k (q=0) Madelung correction; computed as VASP_EXHF - ex_from_H2/nk = -418.97645251 - (-419.678180) = 0.701728 eV

      CONTROL PARAMETER FOR THIS RUN:
      PROPAG   : S2
      EQLB     : 0.2
      DTAU     : 0.0001         #### small DTAU needed: h_sic has large neg diagonal for 8k
      NWAK     : 50
      NSTP     : 100
      BLKDIV   : 10
      KPOINT   : 8
      TMAX     : 184800
      OTEY     : 6
      TIMG     : 10
      TREL     : 10
      SEED     : 12345

      DATA FILES:
      H1FILE   : ~/projects/data/vafpy_v2/H1_svd.npy
      H2FILE   : ~/projects/data/vafpy_v2/H2_zip.npy
      QLIST    : ~/projects/data/vafpy_v2/Q_list.npy

      METHOD IMPLEMENTATION:
      UPDTM    : H
      REOPRI   : 1
      REORTHO  : QR      #### QR or Cholesky (Cholesky requires JAX backend)
      REBPRI   : 2
      REBMTH   : local   #### local or global
      SMFRQ    : 1
      CHPRI    : 4999

      SINGULAR VALUE DECOMPOSITION and HATREE-FOCK:
      SVD      : False
      SVDT     : 1e-7
      HF       : True           #### run HF test first
      HFTAU    : 1.0e-10
      HFSTP    : 1

      Config:
      PRECSION : Double
      BACKEND  : NumPy
